msgstr "Bain mionsamhlacha caibidil"

#. Description of setting #37044 Extract chapter thumbnails"
msgctxt "#37045"
msgid "Extract chapter thumbnails for presentation in the chapters / bookmarks dialogue. This might increase CPU load."
msgstr "Bain mionsamhlacha caibidil le cur i láthair sna caibidlí /leabharmharcanna idirphlé. D'fhéadfadh sé seo ualach LAP a mhéadú."

